ds—\nI believed I would never return from here.","startTime":250.785,"endTime":258.225,"words":[{"word":"Think,","start":250.945,"end":251.505},{"word":"reader,","start":251.505,"end":252.305},{"word":"how","start":252.305,"end":252.705},{"word":"I","start":252.705,"end":252.785},{"word":"felt","start":252.785,"end":253.065},{"word":"at","start":253.065,"end":253.185},{"word":"the","start":253.185,"end":253.465},{"word":"sound","start":253.465,"end":253.665},{"word":"of","start":253.665,"end":253.905},{"word":"those","start":253.905,"end":254.145},{"word":"cursed","start":254.145,"end":254.625},{"word":"words—","start":254.625,"end":255.745},{"word":"I","start":255.745,"end":255.852},{"word":"believed","start":255.852,"end":256.225},{"word":"I","start":256.225,"end":256.465},{"word":"would","start":256.465,"end":256.705},{"word":"never","start":256.705,"end":257.185},{"word":"return","start":257.185,"end":257.545},{"word":"from","start":257.545,"end":257.785},{"word":"here.","start":257.785,"end":258.225}]},{"id":26,"speaker":"dante","text":"My dear guide,\" I said, \"you who have given me\nsafety more than seven times,\nwho have pulled me back from dangers that loomed before me,\ndon't abandon me in this ruin.\nIf we can't go forward,\nlet's quickly retrace our steps together.","startTime":258.225,"endTime":272.225,"words":[{"word":"My","start":258.31,"end":258.55},{"word":"dear","start":258.55,"end":258.87},{"word":"guide,\"","start":258.87,"end":259.75},{"word":"I","start":259.75,"end":259.95},{"word":"said,","start":259.95,"end":260.63},{"word":"\"you","start":260.63,"end":260.95},{"word":"who","start":260.95,"end":261.11},{"word":"have","start":261.11,"end":261.31},{"word":"given","start":261.31,"end":261.51},{"word":"me","start":261.51,"end":261.71},{"word":"safety","start":261.71,"end":262.23},{"word":"more","start":262.23,"end":262.47},{"word":"than","start":262.47,"end":262.79},{"word":"seven","start":262.79,"end":263.03},{"word":"times,","start":263.03,"en