 and no battling in my head.\nI couldn't hear what he proposed to them,\nbut he wasn't with them long\nbefore they all raced back inside.\nOur enemies slammed the gates\nin my lord's face, leaving him outside.\nHe turned back to me with slow steps,\neyes downcast, his forehead stripped\nof all confidence. Sighing, he said:","startTime":289.225,"endTime":316.75,"words":[{"word":"So","start":289.55,"end":289.87},{"word":"my","start":289.87,"end":290.11},{"word":"sweet","start":290.11,"end":290.43},{"word":"father","start":290.43,"end":290.83},{"word":"goes","start":290.83,"end":291.07},{"word":"on","start":291.07,"end":291.39},{"word":"and","start":291.39,"end":291.55},{"word":"abandons","start":291.55,"end":292.11},{"word":"me,","start":292.11,"end":292.75},{"word":"and","start":292.75,"end":292.99},{"word":"I","start":292.99,"end":293.257},{"word":"remain","start":293.257,"end":293.603},{"word":"suspended","start":293.603,"end":294.23},{"word":"between","start":294.23,"end":294.51},{"word":"doubt","start":294.51,"end":294.99},{"word":"and","start":294.99,"end":295.15},{"word":"hope,","start":295.15,"end":295.87},{"word":"yes","start":295.87,"end":296.39},{"word":"and","start":296.39,"end":296.67},{"word":"no","start":296.67,"end":296.99},{"word":"battling","start":296.99,"end":297.43},{"word":"in","start":297.43,"end":297.55},{"word":"my","start":297.55,"end":297.83},{"word":"head.","start":297.83,"end":298.83},{"word":"I","start":298.83,"end":298.937},{"word":"couldn't","start":298.937,"end":299.27},{"word":"hear","start":299.27,"end":299.43},{"word":"what","start":299.43,"end":299.55},{"word":"he","start":299.55,"end":299.71},{"word":"proposed","start":299.71,"end":300.15},{"word":"to","start":300.15,"end":300.27},{"word":"them,","start":300.27,"end":300.79},{"word":"but","start":300.79,"end":300.91},{"word":"he","start":300.91,"end":301.07},{"word":"wasn't","start":301.07,"end":301.31},{"word":"with","start":301.31,"end":301.47},{"word":"them","start":301.47,"end